<title>UK: World Bank ups bond to 4.0 bln Philippine pesos.</title>
<headline>World Bank ups bond to 4.0 bln Philippine pesos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 4.0 billion Philippine pesos from 3.0 billion</p>
<p>Philippine pesos, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT  **4.0 BLN PHP   COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    11.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.875   PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.50    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    **ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 13.MAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/PH</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
